      "user": "Xelod93",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/5784470-1668777444.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Over 40 hours in game and I can only say – fantastic and incredibly addictive! Great atmosphere, gameplay holds your attention from the very first moment. Top recommendation for buying via Instant Gaming, everything went smoothly!"
    },
    {
      "game": "Final Fantasy Resonance",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/22936/450x258/final-fantasy-resonance-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1793919600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/22936-buy-final-fantasy-resonance-pc-steam/",
      "user": "thybak",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "A great HD-2D JRPG with glimpses from all the Final Fantasy Saga, combining well known mechanics from Octopath Traveler with some interesting additions as the visions, a flexible way to build your party. Story wise the title is sufficiently good to keep you hooked with a great soundtrack as one would expect from this franchise.\n\n\n\nOverall a great title worth to play!"
    },
    {
      "game": "Life is Strange: Double Exposure",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/6829/450x258/life-is-strange-double-exposure-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1793919600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/6829-buy-life-is-strange-double-exposure-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "Al1X1RO",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/2093216-1722852977.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "The story is so far pretty nice, not on the level of the previous games but nice enough. While im fine with how the game is, i feel like this one in particular is forcing the lgbt stuff a lot down the players throat on every occasion it gets. Previous games were fine, couldnt complain but this one is too much, but not enough to turn me away for now at least.\n\n\n\nAside from that, the game has terrible optimization. I started it on PS5 but i lost interest, tho i must say it looked and ran pretty badly. Worse on PC. While i can run to a certain extent newer games, this one is horrendous something between 30 and 60fps depending on area and whether there are people in it or not."
    },
    {
      "game": "ARC Raiders",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/10142/450x258/arc-raiders-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1793919600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/10142-buy-arc-raiders-pc-steam/",
      "user": "PK3K",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "The game had potential, then it went to trash almost right away. Rampant cheating and extract camping. Sometimes you'd see 3 rats each jorking it in their own corner. Free kits are abysmal since you dont need nothing else to PVP, therefore your loadout is obsolote. Any and all . If you dont like PVP and decide on the PVE variant, there will be people sabotaging you or stealing the loot you fight for with the NPC robots. If you arent buying this specifically for its mediocre PVP mechanics. AVOID AT ALL COSTS."
    }
  ],
